WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.176 --> 00:00:10.008
Yes, you can choose whatever image you want as a wedding parent on the day.

2
00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:21.336
Instead of just saying, "Make me pretty," describe it with adjectives — "demure," "elegant," "cute," "glamorous," "clean."

3
00:00:21.672 --> 00:00:25.992
A demure look and a glamorous look are two very different things.

4
00:00:26.328 --> 00:00:36.144
Once you pick an image, everything — hair, makeup, even the smallest accessory — follows it, giving you a look you'll love far more.

5
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:45.384
Whether demure, glamorous, or cute, deciding on your image first will make you an even more stunning wedding parent.
